"src": "Book problem",
"title": "Problem 4.3 — beam with an inclined load",
"statement": "A uniform horizontal beam (l = 4 m, weight 400 N) is hinged at A and supported by a roller at D, d = 3 m from A. A force P = 1000 N, directed 60° below the horizontal, is applied at the free end B. Find the reaction components at A and D.",
"fig": "<svg class=\"figsvg\" viewBox=\"0 0 460 246\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Beam with roller support\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\"><title>Beam with roller support</title><defs></defs><line x1=\"60.0\" y1=\"110.0\" x2=\"380.0\" y2=\"110.0\" stroke=\"var(--text)\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M60.0 114 l-11 18 h22 z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--text)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"44.0\" y1=\"132.0\" x2=\"76.0\" y2=\"132.0\" stroke=\"var(--text)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M300.0 114 l-10 14 h20 z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--text)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"295.0\" cy=\"133.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--text)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"305.0\" cy=\"133.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--text)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"284.0\" y1=\"137.0\" x2=\"316.0\" y2=\"137.0\" stroke=\"var(--text)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"220.0\" y1=\"50.0\" x2=\"220.0\" y2=\"95.0\" stroke=\"var(--bad)\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"220.0,106.0 214.5,95.0 225.5,95.0\" fill=\"var(--bad)\"/><text x=\"220.0\" y=\"44.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--bad)\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">W = 400 N</text><line x1=\"380.0\" y1=\"110.0\" x2=\"405.5\" y2=\"154.2\" stroke=\"var(--bad)\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,163.7 400.7,156.9 410.3,151.4\" fill=\"var(--bad)\"/><text x=\"417.0\" y=\"159.7\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"var(--bad)\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">P = 1000 N</text><line x1=\"60.0\" y1=\"210.0\" x2=\"220.0\" y2=\"210.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"60.0\" y1=\"205.0\" x2=\"60.0\" y2=\"215.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"220.0\" y1=\"205.0\" x2=\"220.0\" y2=\"215.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"140.0\" y=\"225.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"12\">2 m</text><line x1=\"220.0\" y1=\"210.0\" x2=\"300.0\" y2=\"210.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"220.0\" y1=\"205.0\" x2=\"220.0\" y2=\"215.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"300.0\" y1=\"205.0\" x2=\"300.0\" y2=\"215.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"225.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"12\">1 m</text><line x1=\"300.0\" y1=\"210.0\" x2=\"380.0\" y2=\"210.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"300.0\" y1=\"205.0\" x2=\"300.0\" y2=\"215.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"380.0\" y1=\"205.0\" x2=\"380.0\" y2=\"215.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"340.0\" y=\"225.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"12\">1 m</text></svg>",
"steps": [
"P_x = 1000 cos 60° = 500 N, P_y = 1000 sin 60° = 866 N (downward). Beam weight 400 N acts at 2 m.",
"ΣM_A = 0: R_D(3) − 400(2) − 866(4) = 0 ⇒ R_D = (800 + 3464)/3 = 1421 N (up).",
"ΣF_x = 0: R_Ax = 500 N (opposing P_x).",
"ΣF_y = 0: R_Ay = R_D − 400 − 866 = 155.3 N (negative ⇒ downward)."
],
"answer": "R_D = 1421 N ↑;  R_Ax = 500 N;  R_Ay = 155.3 N ↓",
